  "description": "⭐ <em>Experience an enchanting evening of classical music with Bach Concertos by Candlelight in London, featuring the acclaimed Piccadilly Sinfonietta and renowned guest soloists in a beautiful, candlelit setting.</em><br><br><strong>Highlights</strong><br> 🎼 Hear Bach’s most beloved concertos performed live by top-tier musicians<br> 🕯️ A stunning candlelit atmosphere inside the architectural gem of St Mary le Strand<br> 🎻 Enjoy passionate performances by exceptional soloists on piano, violin, and oboe<br> 🍷 Make a night of it — the venue is just a short stroll from some of London’s best bars and restaurants<br><br><strong>General Info</strong><br> 📅 Date: Choose your preferred date in the ticket selector<br> 🕒 Time: 6:00 PM – 7:00 PM<br> 📍 Location: St Mary le Strand, The Strand, London, WC2 1ES<br> 🎶 Each date features a unique programme and lineup of performers — check the schedule for details<br><br><strong>Description</strong><br> Step into a world of timeless elegance as <strong><em>Bach Concertos by Candlelight </em></strong>brings the genius of Johann Sebastian Bach to life in one of London’s most intimate and beautiful venues. With the gentle flicker of candlelight illuminating the exquisite surroundings of <strong>St Mary le Strand</strong>, the acclaimed <strong>Piccadilly Sinfonietta </strong>and guest soloists will perform some of Bach’s most stirring concertos — rich in invention, emotional depth, and sparkling interplay. From the joyfully expressive piano concertos to the haunting beauty of the violin and oboe arrangements, each concert offers a unique lineup and a soul-stirring musical experience. A perfect way to celebrate the weekend with sophistication and charm.<br><br><strong>Programmes and performers</strong><br><br><strong><u>22.10.26</u></strong><br>Featuring: The Piccadilly Sinfonietta, Warren Mailley Smith (piano)<br>Programme: J.S. Bach – Keyboard Concerto No. 4 in A major, BWV 1055, J.S. Bach – Violin Concerto in A minor, BWV 1041, J.S. Bach – Keyboard Concerto No. 3 in D major, BWV 1054<br><br><strong><u>12.11.26</u></strong><br>Featuring: The Piccadilly Sinfonietta, Warren Mailley-Smith (piano)<br>Programme: J.S. Bach – Partita in C minor, BWV 826, J.S. Bach – Keyboard Concerto No. 2 in E major, BWV 1053, J.S. Bach – Keyboard Concerto No. 7 in G minor, BWV 1058&nbsp;<br><br><strong><u>26.11.26</u></strong><br>Featuring: The Piccadilly Sinfonietta, Warren Mailley-Smith (piano)<br>Programme: J.S. Bach – Keyboard Concerto No. 5 in F minor, BWV 1056, J.S. Bach – Brandenburg Concerto No. 3 in G major, BWV 1048, J.S. Bach – Keyboard Concerto No. 1 in D minor, BWV 1052<br>",
